module closers .
rem run: one_line 4
rem run: spread 4

fn one_line input x u64 . output u64 .
  requires le x. 1000 . .
do
  return add mul x. x. . add x. 1 . . .
end .

rem ko: 인자를 여러 줄에 늘어놓아도 표시가 필요 없다 --- 개행은 공백이다 /// en: spreading arguments over several lines needs no marker --- a newline is whitespace
fn spread input x u64 . output u64 .
  requires le x. 1000 . .
do
  return add
    mul x. x. .
    add x.
         1 . . .
end .
